meta {
  name: Get Roles (Dropdown)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/requests/roles
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Roles (Dropdown)

  Roles offered in the Add / Edit User form, in display order, with the label and
  description set in Org Setup → Roles. Hidden roles and SuperUser are never included.
  Falls back to the default 8 roles while the `roles` table is empty.
  Any logged-in user.

  ## Response
  ```json
  {
    "roles": [
      { "value": "Requestor", "label": "Requestor", "description": "Raises requests" },
      { "value": "DeptHOD",   "label": "Department Head", "description": "Handles requests assigned to the department" }
    ]
  }
  ```
  `value` is the real role saved on the user; `label` is display only.
}
